flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> Validate{Input Valid?}

    Validate -- No --> Error[Throw Exception]
    Validate -- Yes --> Sanitize["Sanitize Description<br/>(Keep only safe chars)"]

    Sanitize --> PathGen["Build Folder Name:<br/>YYYYMMDD_SanitizedDesc"]

    PathGen --> CheckExists{"Storage.exists(path)?"}

    CheckExists -- Yes --> Suffix["Append suffix to NAME<br/>(e.g. _Dentista_1)"]
    Suffix --> CheckExists

    CheckExists -- No --> CreateDir["Storage.createDirectory(path)"]

    CreateDir --> InitSlots["RuleEngine: Init Slots"]
    InitSlots --> SaveMeta["Repository.save(Entry)"]

    SaveMeta --> End((Return UUID))